primaryGenreName":"Travel","primaryGenreId":6003,"sellerName":"Airbnb, Inc.","isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"version":"26.46","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"THE APP THAT TRAVELS WITH YOU\nExploring the world is easier than ever. With the Airbnb app, your trip is at your fingertips, from planning to booking to travelling. Book homes and hotels all over the world, discover one-of-a-kind experiences and find services that make the trip easier. And now, with travel recommendations from friends you’ve connected with, it’s simpler than ever to find and book a trip you’ll love.\n\nCHECK INTO HOMES OR HOTELS\nThere’s a place on Airbnb for every trip – a cabin for the whole family, a boutique hotel for a solo weekend or a luxury villa for a special getaway. Explore 8+ million holiday rentals and a growing collection of hotels across 220+ countries and regions. Use over 80 filters to set your preferences and find exactly what you’re looking for. Plus, get details of homes or hotels at a glance on the listing page, and check ratings and reviews from guests who’ve stayed there.\n\nPACK MORE INTO YOUR TRIPS\nYour trip lives in the Trips tab – booking details, recommendations and even group messages. Get a day-by-day view of your check-in times, special instructions and entry codes – even when you’re offline. Plus, save the places you want to visit or add them to a shared itinerary so that your group can plan together and decide what to do next.\n\nBOOK THE EXTRAS THAT MAKE YOUR TRIP EASIER\nNow you can book thousands of services at various price points, in cities around the world. Get your travel day sorted with car hire* , grocery delivery and luggage storage through the Airbnb app.** Once you’re settled in, find services that add to your holiday rental, such as a massage, prepared meals or a personal training session.**  \n\nDON’T JUST SEE A PLACE, EXPERIENCE IT \nFind thousands of experiences around the world, hosted by locals who can show you a different side of their city.. Book local tours, nature walks, unique classes or tickets to must-see attractions.\n\nWANT TO HOST? YOU’RE IN THE RIGHT PLACE\nWhether you want to host a holiday rental, experience or service, Airbnb is the place. Get the platform, AI-powered tools and support to reach millions of travellers and grow your business.\n\nIF YOU’VE READ THIS FAR, YOU COULD’VE BOOKED A TRIP BY NOW\nNow it’s time to get out of the app store and into the app. And then, out into the world.\n\n*Car Hire Disclosure: CarTrawler, a third party, and its suppliers are responsible for the booking, hire, applicable regulations and payment.\n\n**Services Disclosure: Services are not available in all geos. Services provided by hosts are not available in Brazil and Puerto Rico.","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.70485,"languageCodesISO2A":["SQ","AR","HY","AZ","BS","BG","CA","HR","CS","DA","NL","EN","ET","FI","FR","KA","DE","EL","HE","HI","HU","IS","ID","GA","IT","JA","KN","KO","LV","LT","MK","MS","MT","MR","NB","PL","PT","RO","RU","SR","ZH","SK","SL","ES","SW","SV","TL","TH","ZH","TR","UK","VI","XH","ZU"],"sellerUrl":"https://airbnb.com","fileSizeBytes":"368466944","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":12658,"trackContentRating":"4+","userRatingCount":12658}